## Choose exactly one candidate (priority order)

Do **not** invent work. Do **not** add OPEN rows, sweep files, or checklist items this tick to justify a pick. A valid `source:` must already exist on disk.

1. If an **active** sprint (else latest **planned**) has an unchecked **code** `- [ ]` line → **that line only**. Skip `[operator]` / `[manual]` / `[human]` / `[ops]` / `[no-auto]` and release-runbook wording (publish draft, wait for Actions, deploy staging, smoke installer, APPDATA confirm, merge the PR). Same idea as `isOperatorTask` in `<paths.engine>/autonomy/lib/sprint-resolve.mjs`.
2. Else a feature marked failing / lacking evidence in the features ledger.
3. Else a concrete OPEN item in `open-questions.md` that is already listed and code-fixable.
4. Else an open high/medium finding in the latest **existing** sweep that is code-fixable.
5. Else **idle** — no tick-NN, no product edits; journal `Result=idle`.

